WEBVTT

00:00:01.670 --> 00:00:03.720
The black hole generating experiment.

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:07.950
The goal is to create a man-made micro black hole...

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:12.340
...by accelerating electrons and protons to almost the speed of light.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:18.030
The black hole was supposed to be a stable source of energy...

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:21.680
...that would improve the life of humankind.

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:22.820
However...

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:26.770
The experiment failed.

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:31.180
A portal to other worlds had been born.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:34.850
It brought strange demons...

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:37.370
...and inescapable destruction.

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:44.270
Abandoned by God...

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:46.980
...humans made a deal with demons.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:55.760
You became a demon, too?

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:57.730
I'm not the only one.

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:02.020
Most people present at the center of the disaster ended up like this.

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:04.960
This is the truth behind this world's destruction.

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:08.080
The portal to other worlds still exists...

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:10.590
...in the lowest level of the central vortex.

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:12.250
As long as it exists...

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:14.440
...this world's destruction is guaranteed.

00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:16.430
Is there no way to stop it?

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:18.790
That is your decision.

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.170
Will you save this world?

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:25.110
Or will you return to your own?

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:27.110
Which will you choose?

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:28.560
I...

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:30.660
Whichever you end up choosing...

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:32.850
...there's someone I'd like you to meet.

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:33.990
Who is it?

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:35.730
Naotaka Natsume.

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:39.710
Your brother, the central figure of this experiment...

00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:42.480
...and my boyfriend.

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:45.920
<i>Asura Cryin' 2</i>

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:49.420
"Remaining Life, Scattered Life"

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:51.840
Naotaka is inside the superstring gravity reactor.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:55.820
That place differs from normal space.

00:01:56.330 --> 00:01:57.330
What does that mean?

00:01:57.430 --> 00:01:58.900
How should I know?

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:00.870
In simple terms, it's another world.

00:02:01.490 --> 00:02:03.400
You could call it a demon world.

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:05.490
How are we going to get to a place like that?

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:09.240
In the deepest part of this building is a route known as the demon bridge.

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:12.820
However, only demons, contractors...

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:15.010
...and burial dolls can cross.

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:17.010
So that's why Takatsuki...

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:21.830
I'm sorry, Natsume-kun.

00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:25.350
Regardless, we need to meet with Naotaka.

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:27.460
Kurogane is with him.

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:28.890
Kurogane?

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:31.000
Not just Kurogane.

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:34.110
Naotaka maintains all the Asura Machina.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.940
Dimensional diving chamber Uzushio...

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:40.820
He lives in a unique dimension.

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:46.180
Wow, you can't see the bottom!

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:47.900
How far down does this go?

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:50.550
The demon bridge is the entrance to another world.

00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:53.370
Time and space behave irregularly.

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:56.490
Do you mean there's no end?

00:02:57.090 --> 00:02:58.170
Exactly.

00:02:58.210 --> 00:02:59.540
Hey, wait a second...

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:01.440
We finally connected.

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:14.220
Where are we?

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:15.850
Don't look!

00:03:15.850 --> 00:03:17.570
Huh? What's wrong with you?

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:19.710
Don't!

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:27.580
Didn't I tell you not to look?

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:29.360
You pervert.

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:31.360
I-it's just a statue!

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:32.590
Not quite.

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:34.840
Welcome to Uzushio...

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:36.670
...my second brother.

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:38.470
You're...

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.990
He's the first world's Naotaka Natsume.

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:45.720
These statues...

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:49.630
...are proof these girls that lost their souls were once alive.

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:52.050
Lost their souls?

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:56.550
You mean...

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:58.910
They're the physical bodies...

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:02.160
...of burial dolls that lost their souls.

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:03.240
That's terrible.

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:04.850
Tomo, look!

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.790
Takatsuki? Why?

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:10.590
I'm sure you know why.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:14.750
You saw her disappear.

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:19.410
You saw the moment Tomoharu Natsume, my brother, died.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:26.490
When my brother took control of Hagane...

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:29.200
...Kanade Takatsuki offered up herself.

00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:33.510
She said she wanted to save her friend Misao Minakami.

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:36.970
That's how it happened in the first world, anyway.

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.950
I thought I had prepared myself after hearing Ania's story...

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:41.950
...but it's still painful.

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:47.720
I will send you back to the second world.

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:51.750
Ania, repair Kurogane.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.940
As soon as you're done, we'll send Tomoharu to the second world.

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:55.810
Yes.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:57.220
W-wait!

00:04:58.050 --> 00:05:00.620
Isn't there anything I can do?

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:03.140
This world will be destroyed.

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:04.550
It's already been decided.

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:07.580
Isn't there a way to stop its destruction?

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:08.530
No...

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:10.660
...well, there was one.

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:13.270
Tell me how to do it.

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:15.340
Even if you knew, you'd be powerless to act.

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:16.630
Brother!

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:19.590
Then I will show you...

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.880
...why this world must be destroyed.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:27.100
The gate to other worlds...

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:31.700
When the black hole experiment failed and ran out of control...

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:35.160
...a tremendous amount of energy was created accidentally...

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:37.020
...opening a portal to other worlds.

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:42.010
Through interactions with other worlds...

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:44.420
...this one is slowly eliminated.

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:50.070
The existence of the entire world is being rejected and erased.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:53.260
The first world is vanishing.

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:55.390
This world is dying.

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:57.590
How can I stop it?

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:00.590
A vanishing world will fall into the gate...

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.350
...and be completely destroyed.

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:07.010
If we close the gate and return the world to its proper state...

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:08.870
...the vanishing should stop.

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:10.980
Then what are we waiting for?

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:14.590
If it were possible, we would have done it right away.

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.780
To destroy the gate...

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:21.380
...we would need the same amount of energy used to create it.

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:24.450
It's only possible with the most powerful Asura Machina...

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:26.290
...Hagane.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:30.310
But this world's Tomoharu already failed once.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:34.160
That was why he chose to start over.

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:35.770
No...

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:39.310
Besides, Tokiya has Hagane.

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:42.400
I only maintain the Asura Machina.

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:43.750
I don't control them.

00:06:44.450 --> 00:06:49.300
I have no power over an Asura Machina with a proper handler.

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:51.010
So then...

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:55.420
Without Hagane, there's no way to save this world.

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:57.790
You understand now, Tomoharu?

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:02.450
Hey, couldn't you make Hagane...

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:03.790
...by combining Kurogane and Shirogane?

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:07.020
Don't be ridiculous.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:09.070
No, it may be possible.

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:12.800
Kurgane's control over gravity...

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:15.680
...and Shirogane's manipulation of space.

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:21.370
Combining the two would create an Asura Machina with complete control over space.

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:23.610
It would be the same as Hagane.

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:26.320
Good idea, right?

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:28.430
We can't do that. The risk is too great.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:32.780
We don't know what would happen to the handler and burial doll.

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:35.910
Worst case scenario, both could disappear.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.320
Return to the second world...

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:42.890
...and finish what my brother started.

00:07:43.470 --> 00:07:45.210
But the people of this world...

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:48.230
Do you want to die here?

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:52.810
You want to return to your own world.

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:55.210
Don't worry about anything else.

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:56.760
Brother...

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:01.190
Ania, repair Kurogane.

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:02.060
Yes.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:03.820
Nia...

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:05.290
..don't just repair it.

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:08.550
Tomoharu...

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.700
It's far too dangerous.

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:14.780
But if I have a chance to save this world...

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:15.810
...I've got to try.

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:18.570
You're not the only one! You'll be putting Misao in danger!

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:21.070
I agree with Tomo.

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:22.900
Please, brother.

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:23.990
Nia.

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:31.760
I guess you're the same no matter which world you're from.

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:34.000
Even though you're an idiot...

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:36.480
...nothing can break your resolve.

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:41.330
Talk about bad timing...

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.230
Tomoharu, give me a hand.

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:50.150
Stray daughters are trying to enter this world through the gate.

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:54.500
Naotaka-san stops them right at the gate.

00:08:55.530 --> 00:08:59.490
Dimensional diving chamber Uzushio is the Asura Machina mother ship...

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:01.890
...as well as our front-line base.

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:03.360
Then...

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:05.270
It's about to become a battlefield.

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:07.010
Natsume-kun...

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:24.750
Wow, Tomo!

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:25.710
Where now, brother?

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.150
We've got two more intruders.

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:29.890
They're coming from behind.

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:50.240
Don't.

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:52.870
You can't fight any more.

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:58.180
Natsume-kun...

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:21.160
Are we going to be okay against this many?

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:22.940
We'll figure it out.

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:34.790
Tomo, if you use your demon powers too much, you'll vanish.

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:36.630
Stop trying to scare me.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:40.610
I'll make a contract with you if you beg for it.

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:42.040
Don't be ridiculous.

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:45.720
Besides, can you even enter a contract with a burial doll?

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:47.570
I wonder.

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:50.340
We don't know how to make a contract anyway.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:52.560
It doesn't really matter.

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:53.570
Why not?

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:57.260
A male demon loses memories of his contractor, right?

00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:00.490
I don't want to forget you, Misao.

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:02.640
Tomo...

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:05.520
I bet you'd try to trick me, too.

00:11:05.980 --> 00:11:07.840
Like lying about lending me money.

00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:09.060
Tomo!

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:10.820
I'm just kidding.

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:16.950
Well, I don't want you to vanish or lose your memories.

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:20.410
If I forget, I can just make more.

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:26.330
It's better to make lots of memories than lose them.

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:29.620
No one would be unhappy.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:31.160
Tomo...

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:33.640
You idiot.

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:34.720
What?

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:36.310
Who are you trying to impress?

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:37.580
That isn't like you.

00:11:37.640 --> 00:11:39.230
Give me a break.

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:54.540
Tomo, are you okay?

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:56.500
Yeah, but...

00:11:57.170 --> 00:11:58.390
This place is crawling with them.

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:00.000
We just have to do it.

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:01.660
You've managed to hold on for quite a while.

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:02.800
Brother.

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:04.620
We're finished with repairs.

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:07.670
Call your Asura Machina's name.

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:10.540
Misao, let's do this.

00:12:10.670 --> 00:12:11.350
Got it.

00:12:12.590 --> 00:12:14.040
Come, Kurogane!

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:17.320
From the abyss blacker than darkness...

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:20.770
...it is the shadow cast by the light of science.

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:31.520
This is the new Kurogane.

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:34.030
Let's go!

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:54.030
Amazing...

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:56.700
I'd expect no less from my brother.

00:12:57.340 --> 00:13:00.220
Yes. Its output exceeds Hagane's.

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:02.560
We might be able to pull this off.

00:13:05.670 --> 00:13:08.110
See that? That's the gate to other worlds.

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:09.040
Yeah.

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:12.920
If you can push Kurogane-kai's power to the limit...

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:15.130
...you'll be able to destroy it.

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:16.380
Wait.

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:18.010
If I do that, what will happen to Misao?

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:20.450
I'll be fine.

00:13:20.850 --> 00:13:22.070
Fine?

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:23.210
That's impossible.

00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:24.430
Remember what I said?

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:28.970
I don't want anyone to be hurt in my place.

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:30.370
Misao...

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:32.130
Tomo, let's do this.

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:34.740
Let's defend this world together.

00:13:35.320 --> 00:13:35.940
But...

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:38.450
I definitely won't disappear.

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:42.070
No matter what happens, I'll always be with you.

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:47.070
Alright, Misao.

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:51.720
Let's go, Kurogane!

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:00.750
Natsume-kun!

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:07.210
That's...

00:14:10.690 --> 00:14:11.940
What is that?

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:14.380
It's the daughter that guards the gate.

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:16.310
She's a formidable opponent.

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:19.490
Tomoharu and Hagane were able to fight her off once...

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:22.270
Well, it looks like she's back.

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:36.060
Now's the time.

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:37.530
Do it, Kurogane!

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:52.420
Impossible...

00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:08.640
Takatsuki!

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:22.240
Go, Kurogane!

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:34.790
Takatsuki!

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:36.510
Takatsuki-san!

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:41.440
She's vanishing? Why?

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:44.500
I'm sorry...

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:46.180
...I lied.

00:15:46.780 --> 00:15:48.980
I wanted to stay with you...

00:15:49.450 --> 00:15:50.510
...Natsume-kun.

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:52.580
Don't speak! I'll save you...

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:57.490
I was so happy when you told me you loved me.

00:15:57.780 --> 00:15:59.580
That's all I wanted...

00:16:00.030 --> 00:16:01.480
You can't be satisfied with just that.

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:05.000
You deserve to more happiness than this.

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:06.720
When you want something, you can say you want it.

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:09.000
When you love someone, you can say you love them.

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:11.840
Minakami-san...

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:17.610
You can have this idiot and a ghost of a sister-in-law if that's what you want.

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:20.680
That would have been wonderful.

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:22.380
Takatsuki...

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:25.300
Tomoharu Natsume...

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:31.940
...do you vow to be Kanade Takatsuki's lifelong contractor?

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:33.890
I do! I promise! So please...

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:34.970
I will...

00:16:36.130 --> 00:16:36.770
...allow it.

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:40.250
Takatsuki!

00:16:44.780 --> 00:16:45.510
Tomo...

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:50.330
Kurogane!

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:57.000
From the abyss blacker than darkness...

00:16:57.830 --> 00:17:00.750
...it is the shadow cast by the light of science.

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:10.980
Do it!

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:16.510
Naotaka, how are Tomoharu and the others?

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:18.310
There's not enough power.

00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:21.070
His burial doll won't hold up against this.

00:17:21.670 --> 00:17:22.540
What?

00:17:22.970 --> 00:17:24.270
It's the same as before.

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:26.640
If that daughter hadn't interfered...

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:30.200
At this rate, Misao's soul will disappear.

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:32.620
Tomoharu, stop!

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:34.380
We'll find another way!

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:35.420
Tomoharu!

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:42.560
I'm sorry, Tomo.

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:44.340
It's my fault.

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:51.510
But I will protect this other Tomo.

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:54.900
Stop, Misao!

00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:57.300
There's no reason for you to die!

00:17:57.860 --> 00:17:58.650
Nia-chan.

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:03.660
I'm just going to go save Tomo's and my world.

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:04.880
Misao!

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:06.060
Stop!

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:08.740
Misao!

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:12.360
What's going on?

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:14.580
Don't worry.

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:17.580
We're here for you, Tomo.

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:19.730
Misao?

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:54.630
Take this.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:56.630
An igniter?

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:01.270
After doing some research, I've determined it's a causality control device...

00:19:01.770 --> 00:19:04.010
...usable only by Asura Cryin'.

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:06.470
Causality control device?

00:19:07.280 --> 00:19:10.670
Every phenomenon in this world has a cause and an effect.

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:12.500
It's the principle of causality.

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:16.040
That device will give you full control over causality.

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:18.900
Do you think you could dumb it down a bit?

00:19:19.430 --> 00:19:21.460
With the igniter and Hagane...

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:25.250
...you can change the world as you see fit...

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:27.860
...by controlling space and causality.

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:30.490
Wouldn't that make me God?

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:34.990
That's exactly what Tokiya Kagayaki is trying to do.

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:38.630
He's trying to get back someone he lost.

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:42.030
Can you really trust Tomo with something this important?

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:45.530
I bet he'll use it for something dirty.

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:46.710
No I won't.

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:49.230
You won't make the wrong decision.

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:51.300
You're my brother.

00:19:52.010 --> 00:19:52.800
Brother...

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:54.970
I am truly grateful to you.

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:57.520
This world will no longer be destroyed...

00:19:57.740 --> 00:20:02.160
...and the first world won't be overtaken by the history of the second.

00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:05.820
This is the beginning of our world's future.

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:08.440
I see.

00:20:10.010 --> 00:20:10.740
Tomo...

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:12.230
An.

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:13.760
You came.

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:15.290
Are you going somewhere?

00:20:15.970 --> 00:20:16.490
Yeah.

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:18.700
We'll meet again, right?

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:21.500
I'm sorry.

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:22.700
I see...

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:26.780
Is Takastuki-san the one you chose?

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:28.230
Sorry.

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:31.080
You're so weird, Tomo. All you're doing is apologizing.

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:33.300
I'm sorry.

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:37.210
Come on! At least make a proper good-bye.

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:39.720
Right.

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:45.100
This is my girlfriend.

00:20:46.310 --> 00:20:47.200
I see.

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:50.160
I guess I've been turned down.

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:54.610
Well, bye!

00:20:55.930 --> 00:20:57.090
Did you call her here, Tomo?

00:20:57.820 --> 00:21:00.720
I'm the only one who can give her an answer.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:05.420
I didn't realize you were so popular with the girls, Tomo.

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:09.110
It's time.

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:12.750
The gate to other worlds will close completely soon.

00:21:13.640 --> 00:21:16.600
I'll send you back to the second world before that happens...

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:19.310
...using the power of my Asura Machina.

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:21.840
Your Asura Machina?

00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:23.270
You mean...

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:24.640
Uzushio...

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:28.070
Its true power is travel through space.

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:32.360
Many traveled to other worlds using Uzushio's power...

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:35.470
...in order to save this world.

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:40.130
But this will be the last time I use that power.

00:21:41.990 --> 00:21:43.830
Good bye, Tomoharu.

00:23:20.810 --> 00:23:21.620
Rewind.

00:23:21.870 --> 00:23:22.610
Spiral.

00:23:22.610 --> 00:23:23.170
Right.

00:23:23.170 --> 00:23:23.850
Left.

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:25.060
Life and death.

00:23:25.390 --> 00:23:26.320
Stay by my side.

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:27.350
Stay with me.

00:23:27.640 --> 00:23:30.390
The beginning of the end burned my eyes.

00:23:31.610 --> 00:23:35.010
"My Feelings for You Destroy the World"
